docs {
  One-time bulk import (2026-10-22), row 15 of 28 from `DRIVER_LICENSE_DETAILS_(1).csv`.
  Source truck registration number KA01AS6699 is NOT sent in this request (out of scope for
  `POST /api/drivers` — driver-to-truck assignment is a separate concern, not part of this
